{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "schemas/rpc/exec/abort_bash.json",
  "title": "RPC abort_bash response",
  "description": "按 bid 终止后台 bash 进程（bash 扩展 process_map 查 pid → kill -TERM）。三类失败都以 success:true + data.error 形态返回（缺 bid / 进程不存在 / bash 扩展未启用）。",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "id",
    "type",
    "success",
    "command"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "id": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "type": {
      "const": "response"
    },
    "success": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "command": {
      "const": "abort_bash"
    }
  },
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "properties": {
        "success": {
          "const": true
        },
        "data": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "bid": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "pid": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "command": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "signal": {
                  "const": "SIGTERM"
                },
                "success": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "kill 系统调用是否成功"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "bid",
                "pid",
                "command",
                "signal",
                "success"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "properties": {
                "error": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "error"
              ],
              "description": "进程不存在（附 available: 在跑 bid 列表）/ 缺 bid / bash 扩展未启用"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "success",
        "data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "properties": {
        "success": {
          "const": false
        },
        "error": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "success",
        "error"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "$defs": {
    "requestParams": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "properties": {
        "bid": {
          "description": "后台进程 id（bash 工具返回的 bid）",
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "x-quirks": [
    "所有失败变体都在 success:true 信封内（data.error），只有信封级故障才走 error 分支",
    "P0-1 已修复（fix4/h1-exec-p0）：原实现 process_map 的 blocking_lock()（master@6003182 src/worker_rpc.rs:5508）在 tokio runtime 上下文 panic——abort_bash 一旦走到锁路径（bid 非空且 bash 扩展启用）即杀死 worker 进程（exit 101）无任何响应。现改为 lock().await（临界区纯同步小段：clone 字段即 drop 守卫，不跨 await、不持锁 kill），handler 逻辑抽为 abort_bash_response 可单测（真实 sleep 子进程 kill 验证 4/4 绿）。动态验证已恢复：见 tests/rpc_schema_exec_test.rs（缺 bid 变体 + 未知 bid 走锁路径变体 + worker 存活证明）。"
  ]
}
